    },
    "motivations": "Most DRep voices come from infrastructure, DeFi or stake pools. Almost none come from consumer businesses. I want restaurants, independent venues and the people who eat and drink in them represented in Cardano governance.",
    "objectives": "Atlas is next generation food and drink discovery platform and hospitality business suite that puts a Cardano wallet and utility NFTs behind ordinary dining. As a DRep I will back work that brings real users and real businesses onto Cardano, and I will vote against treasury spend that does not have a clear delivery test.",
    "paymentAddress": "addr1q8ypuue3edxnl230v7vwjjujz93j7ct9s7r04wlg4dwzx8z7dejku287zdckh0m0c5fzx6tqdz5spx8u5h6rmjzxrnpqhk4c6e",
    "qualifications": "Founder and CEO of Atlas, a Cardano integrated hospitality platform.\\n- Operating company: Atlas Group Technologies Ltd, registered in England & Wales.\\n- Production grade Cardano integrations: UTXOS.dev non custodial wallets, Blockfrost mainnet, Mesh SDK transaction building, NFT minting on Cardano, ADA denominated rewards, giftcard settlement.\\n- UK GDPR / Data Protection Act 2018 compliance, published GDPR framework, DSAR pipeline and Right-to-Erasure flows.\\n\\nNearly 20 years of hospitality management",
